<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F11.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="A1.F11.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Data collection rig from the front; the Lidar, Camera, and Radar (red PCB) along with its capture card (green PCB) are visible, while the IMU is hidden inside the red (3D-printed) plastic structure.</span></figcaption>
